@startuml sequence_task
!pragma layout smetana
!include _style.puml
title One task, end to end

participant "IoT\ndevice" as I
participant "Controller" as C
participant "Trust\nstate" as T
participant "Edge\nserver" as S
participant "Ledger" as L

I -> C : 1. auth challenge / verify
C --> I : 2. token (or 403)
I -> C : 3. task request
C -> T : 4. read trust + load
C -> C : 5. p2c select  (0.61 ms mean)
C -> S : 6. dispatch
S --> C : 7. report(status, latency)
C -> T : 8. write evidence
T -> T : 9. 1 s loop: score + anomaly gate
T --> C : 10. quarantine verdict
C -> L : 11. commit block (every 10 updates)
@enduml
